# Mirrored Editor UI docs live under `public/docs/editor/` (tracked git) so production
# builds always ship lowercase `/docs/editor/*` without a GameEngine checkout. Refresh with:
#   GAMEENGINE_ROOT=/path/to/GameEngine npm run sync:engine-docs
# CI still runs sync before build to pick the latest engine commit when secrets are set.

